  "id": "2026",
  "name": "Age of Ruptures (Nov 2026)",
  "description": "November 2026: Russia grinds on in Ukraine, an undeclared US–Israeli war with Iran has closed and reopened Hormuz, the Houthis contest Bab al-Mandab, New START is dead and Washington's tariffs have strained every alliance. The US midterms, Israeli coalition talks and Abu Dhabi peace talks all land in your first month.",
